    <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-139" contextRef="c-25">In 1997 Maine Yankee ("MY") permanently ceased power operations at the Plant and commenced the process of decommissioning the Plant site.  To provide for interim storage of its spent fuel and greater-than-Class C ("GTCC") waste, the Company built an on-site independent spent fuel installation ("ISFSI") and completed the transfer of the spent fuel and GTCC to the new facility in February of 2004.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
